OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over London nightclub
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS singer Chris Brown is sentenced to
OL,8,Feight months in prison, suspended for a
OL,9,Fyear, over an incident at a nightclub
OL,10,Fin Mayfair, London in 2023
OL,12,FBrown, 37, pleaded guilty in July to a
OL,13,Fcharge of affray
OL,15,FThe R&B singer's co-defendant and vocal
OL,16,Fcoach, 40-year-old Omololu Akinlolu,
OL,17,Fgets a four-month sentence - and also
OL,18,Fhas it suspended for a year
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
