OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over London nightclub
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe victim, music producer Abe Diaw,
OL,8,Fneeded hospital treatment for head and
OL,9,Fknee injuries, with CCTV showing Brown
OL,10,Fhitting Diaw on the head with a glass
OL,11,Fbottle
OL,13,FDelivering his sentencing remarks,
OL,14,FJudge Tony Baumgartner says "the
OL,15,Frepeated use" of a bottle was "plainly
OL,16,Fdangerous"
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
