OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over London nightclub
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FAcknowledging the incident was "short",
OL,8,Fthe judge says it was also "intense".
OL,9,FEarlier, defence barristers said this
OL,10,Fwas an "ugly and unattractive
OL,11,Fincident", adding it "was very
OL,12,Fshort-lived"
